Action Input: {"smiles": "C1C=CN2C(=C1)C3=CC=CC=C3C2=O"}

Thought: The search results for the SMILES string "C1C=CN2C(=C1)C3=CC=CC=C3C2=O" did not yield a close match either. I will try another isomer from the list to see if it matches better with the database entries.
