Action: search_by_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "C1C2=C(C=CN=C2)C3=CC=CC=C3O1"}

Thought: The search results for the SMILES string "C1C2=C(C=CN=C2)C3=CC=CC=C3O1" did not yield a close match either. I will try another isomer from the list to see if it matches better with the database entries.
