Action Input: {"smiles": "C1=CC2=CC3=CC=C(NC3=C2C=C1)O"}

Thought: The search results for the SMILES string "C1=CC2=CC3=CC=C(NC3=C2C=C1)O" did not yield a close match either. I will try another isomer from the list to see if it matches better with the database entries.
