Thought: The search results for the SMILES string "C1=CC2=COC(=C2C=C1)C3C=CN=C3" did not yield a close match either. I will try the last isomer from the list to see if it matches better with the database entries.
Action: search_by_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "CC1=C(C=CC(=C1)C#N)C#CCC=O"}

Thought: None of the isomers provided a close match in the NMRShift database. Given the molecular weight from the mass spectrometry data, I should verify the molecular formula and ensure it matches the expected molecular weight. Then, I can attempt to validate the SMILES strings to ensure they are correct representations of the molecular formula.
Action: get_formula_from_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "C/C(=C\\C1=CC2=CC=CC=C2O1)/C#N"}
